      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I think this will be an easy script to create for us to use and will open up lots of stuff we have wished to be able to do for ages now, like activate objects to stay active and changing facial expressions by using Emotes. At least in my theory it should be able to work like that.",
      "viewerReactions": null
